      "text": "What's wrong with this medical-tricorder readout?\nThe readout shows elevated isoboramine (62 ng/mL; reference 35–40) and depressed serotonin uptake. Consistent with early-stage Vulcan neuro-pressure deficit. Recommend mind-meld therapy at 24h intervals.",
