      "source_label": "Claude",
      "source_url": null,
      "text": "# Hailing frequencies\n\nOpen on subspace band 3 unless the target is cloaked.\n\n- Klingon vessels: lead with rank, then ship name.\n- Romulan vessels: do not open first.\n",
